{"articleNo":"2250","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2250&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"『제50회 경상북도민체육대회 자원봉사자 모집 안내』","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.20","hit":"8439","attachments":[{"name":"제50회_경북도민체전_봉사자모집_공고[1][1].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2250&attachNo=70087"},{"name":"도민체전-참가신청서[1].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2250&attachNo=70091"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">구미시에서『제50회 경상북도민체육대회』가 2012년 5월 11일부터 5월14일까지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"> 4일간&nbsp;개최됨에 따라&nbsp;자원봉사자를 아래와 같이 모집한다하오니, 희망하시는 학생은 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 대 회 명 : 제50회 경상북도민체육대회</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 대회기간 : 2012. 5. 11(금) ～ 5. 14(월)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 개최장소 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">구미시민운동장 등 32개 종목별 경기장</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 최 : 경상북도, 경상북도체육회</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 관 : 구미시, 구미시체육회</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 후&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 원 : 경상북도교육청, 구미교육지원청</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양신명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 참가인원 : 35,000명 정도<br><br>붙임 1. 모집공고문 1부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 신청서 1부</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
